commit 42068c42d7bcbd41999dda358bc1de7e88d36f0f
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:02:05 2026 +0330

    test(qa4): align legacy assertions with new QA4 contracts
    
    - brand/tests.py: usp_list no longer merged into services (dedicated
      services field); bare-list error bodies now {'detail': ...}.
    - campaign/tests.py: derive-services tests renamed/updated to the
      core-services+scraped merge; PPC fallback fixtures provide the new
      services field; unsuccessful-engine-400 asserts the {'detail': ...}
      body; premature-COMPLETED test now expects IN_PROGRESS.

